# Wilma, the orange office cat. She lives under Wolfgang's desk in her round cushion.
#
# Same format as wolfgang.sprite (`.` is transparent). Every frame has its own size;
# the app draws frames with their bottom centre on Wilma's spot on the floor.
# Side views face right; the app mirrors them when she walks left.
# Her daily routine (sleeping, waking, wandering, washing …) is in app.js (`Wilma`).

size 18 9
# Bottom centre of her cushion, under the desk between the drawers.
origin 163 171

color O 2a1710  # outline
color D a9501f  # tabby stripes
color M dd7a2e  # orange
color L f2a650  # light orange
color C f6e4c2  # cream: muzzle, chest, paws
color E 8fbe4f  # eyes
color P e48f86  # nose, tongue
color T 23383a  # cushion outline
color t 4d7672  # cushion
color u 7aa69c  # cushion light
color i 355754  # cushion hollow

# ── Cushion: `bed` behind her, `bedfront` (its front rim) over her ──
frame bed 28 8
.....TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT.....
...TTuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuTT...
.TTuuiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiuuTT.
TuuiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiuuT
TtuuuiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiuuutT
TttuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuttT
.TTtttttttttttttttttttttttTT
...TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT...

frame bedfront 28 4
TttuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuttT
TttuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuttT
.TTtttttttttttttttttttttttTT
...TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT...

