# ── Stretching: front down, back up (side view, facing right) ──
frame stretch 24 11
O.......................
OO......................
.OO.OOOO................
..OOMMDMOO..............
...OMDMMDMOO............
...OMMDMMDMMOO.....O..O.
...OMLMMDMMDMMOO..OMOOMO
