...OMO.OOLLLLMMMMOMMMEMO
...OMO...OOOOLLLLOMMMMPO
...OCO.......OOOOOCCCCCO

anim sleep sleep1:1800 sleep2:1800
anim awake awake:2400 awakeblink:140 awake:1600 awakeblink:120
anim sit sit:2200 sitblink:140 sit:2600 sitblink:120 sit:1800
anim wash lick1:300 lick2:300 lick1:300 lick2:300 lick1:300 lick2:300 sit:900
anim walk walk1:140 walk2:140 walk3:140 walk4:140
anim stretch stretch:1600
